      771   function shift-name returns character
      772     ( input p-shift-num like ub.shift-obj.shift-num, input p-shift-name  like ub.shift-obj.shift-name) forward.
      773   DEFINE BUTTON b-goods
      774        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      775        IMAGE-DOWN FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
      776        IMAGE-INSENSITIVE FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
