      830        SIZE 28 BY 3.33.
      831   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-2
      832        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      833        SIZE 28 BY 1.71.
      834   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-3
      835        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      836        SIZE 28 BY 3.33.
      837   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-4
